  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 33 × 19 – 24 ÷ 8 + 4 = 40\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\n33 × 19 – 24 ÷ 8 + 4 = 40 ⇒ 33 × 19 + 24 ÷ 8 – 4 = 40\n\n⇒ 33 × 19 + __**24 ÷ 8**__ – 4 = 40\n\n⇒ __**33 × 19**__ + 3 – 4 = 40\n\n⇒ __**627 + 3**__ – 4 = 40\n\n⇒ __**630 –**____** 4**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 626 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\n33 × 19 – 24 ÷ 8 + 4 = 40 ⇒ 33 ÷ 19 – 24 × 8 + 4 = 40\n\n⇒ __**33 ÷**____** 19**__ – 24 × 8 + 4 = 40\n\n⇒ 1.73 – __**24 **____**×**____** 8**__ + 4 = 40\n\n⇒ __**1.73**____** + 4**__ – 192 = 40\n\n⇒ 5.73 – 192 = 40\n\n⇒ -186.27 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\n33 × 19 – 24 ÷ 8 + 4 = 40 ⇒ 33 + 19 – 24 ÷ 8 × 4 = 40\n\n⇒ 33 + 19 – __**24 ÷ 8**__ × 4 = 40\n\n⇒ 33 + 19 – __**3 **____**×**____** 4**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**33 + 19**__ – 12 = 40\n\n⇒ __**52 – 12**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 40 = 40 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\n33 × 19 – 24 ÷ 8 + 4 = 40 ⇒ 33 × 19 – 24 + 8 ÷ 4 = 40\n\n⇒ 33 × 19 – 24 + __**8 ÷ 4**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**33 × 19**__ – 24 + 2 = 40\n\n⇒ __**627 + 2**__ – 24 = 40\n\n⇒ __**629 – 24**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 605 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
